Subject: [PATCH] Align opt-in native reply waits with bounded V73 generation

Apply after 0001-0003. The original resolver releases SmartReplyer after ten
seconds; a real device request completed after twenty seconds and was lost.
Use 45 seconds for the inner wait and 55 for the notification wrapper while
the native route is enabled. Keep the stock waits and register counts.
This extends patch 0002's opt-in outer wait without replacing its original path.

--- a/smali_classes15/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/service/smartreply/SmartReplyResolver.smali
+++ b/smali_classes15/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/service/smartreply/SmartReplyResolver.smali
@@ -4896,4 +4896,16 @@
 
+    invoke-static {v8}, Lio/mesalabs/rezoss/ai/NativeNowNudgeRoute;->enabled(Landroid/content/Context;)Z
+
+    move-result v3
+
+    if-eqz v3, :rezoss_stock_reply_wait
+
+    const-wide/16 v6, 0x2d
+
+    goto :rezoss_reply_wait_ready
+
+    :rezoss_stock_reply_wait
     const-wide/16 v6, 0xa
 
+    :rezoss_reply_wait_ready
     sget-object v3, Ljava/util/concurrent/TimeUnit;->SECONDS:Ljava/util/concurrent/TimeUnit;
--- a/smali_classes15/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/service/smartreply/NowNudgeConversationActionsHandler.smali
+++ b/smali_classes15/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/service/smartreply/NowNudgeConversationActionsHandler.smali
@@ -1311,3 +1311,3 @@
 
-    const-wide/16 v11, 0x1e
+    const-wide/16 v11, 0x37
 
